    <rdf:Description xmlns:dc="http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/" rdf:about="">
      <dc:title>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">Taking Flight</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:title>
      <dc:description>
        <rdf:Alt>
          <rdf:li xml:lang="x-default">&lt;p&gt;After a training session with Swift Wind and Bow, Adora decides to stop by and see Madam Razz for the first time since the war ended. Razz lets slip that there's a greater power that She-Ra possesses that Adora hasn't attained yet, the power to merge with her steed. Determined to gain this new power, Adora and Swift Wind try their best to merge together into a more powerful form, but their new skills are quickly put to the test when a space mission of Catra's goes badly, badly wrong. (Catradora, Canon, Fluff/Adventure)&lt;/p&gt;</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Alt>
      </dc:description>
      <dc:creator>
        <rdf:Seq>
          <rdf:li>Anonymous</rdf:li>
        </rdf:Seq>
      </dc:creator>
